{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_page", "label": "JSON-Serializer", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_jsonserializer", "label": "JsonSerializer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Default: umschlie\u00dft JSON.stringify/parse mit einem Baum-Walk, der Date, Uint8Array, Map, Set und bigint \u00fcber Type-Tags round-trippt. Universell, menschenlesbar, schema-flexibel \u2014 f\u00fcr die meisten Apps ist ein Wechsel nie n\u00f6tig."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_type_tags", "label": "Type-Tags (__date__, __map__, __set__, __bigint__, __bytes__ \u2026)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stellen echte Instanzen wieder her, aber \u00fcber actor-ts-spezifische Tags \u2014 ein Nicht-actor-ts-Consumer sieht die Tag-Form, keinen blanken Wert. Ein Tag wird nur interpretiert, wenn er der einzige eigene Key eines Objekts ist."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_literal_escape", "label": "__literal__-Escape f\u00fcr tag-f\u00f6rmige Nutzerdaten", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Objekt, dessen einziger Key ein reservierter Tag-Name ist, wird beim Encode gewrappt und round-trippt als Plain-Data."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_bidirectional_map_tags", "label": "BidirectionalMap / BidirectionalMultiMap-Tags", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eigene Tags (#1035, #1037), damit die beiden Framework-Klassen ohne Adapter im persistenten State liegen k\u00f6nnen; geschrieben wird nur die Vorw\u00e4rtsrichtung, die Umkehrung wird beim Dekodieren rekonstruiert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_serializationerror", "label": "SerializationError", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wirft bei undefined, Funktionen, Symbolen, Promise, WeakMap/WeakSet und zirkul\u00e4ren Referenzen (mit Key-Pfad statt gesprengtem Stack) \u2014 strenger als rohes JSON.stringify, das still verwirft."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_class_identity_lost", "label": "Klassenidentit\u00e4t bleibt nicht erhalten", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "toJSON() wird respektiert, sonst dekodieren Klasseninstanzen zu Plain-Objekten: Datenfelder \u00fcberleben, Methoden und instanceof nicht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_undefined_handling_split", "label": "undefined: Serializer wirft, Persistenz-Codec erh\u00e4lt es", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Persistenz-Payload-Codec verwirft undefined-Objekt-Properties wie JSON.stringify und erh\u00e4lt undefined in Wertpositionen (Array-Slots, Set-Member, Map-Eintr\u00e4ge) \u00fcber einen Tag (#889); CborSerializer tr\u00e4gt es \u00fcberall nativ \u2014 die eine Stelle, an der sich die beiden Codecs unterscheiden (#1036)."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_jsonserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_overview_serializer_interface", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_jsonserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_type_tags", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_literal_escape", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_type_tags", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_bidirectional_map_tags", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_type_tags", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_jsonserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_serializationerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_class_identity_lost", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_jsonserializer", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_undefined_handling_split", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_cbor_undefined_native", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_json_type_tags", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_serialization_overview_tagged_json_tree", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/serialization/json.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}